				},
				{
					"id": 750181004,
					"content": "简要说明了刚才的情况…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181017
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750181017,
					"content": "原来是这样…那我检查一下吧！唔——没事，应该没有什么大碍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181005,
					"content": "不管怎么说，它愿意吃药了就是好事！而且也知道了它的反应，之后可以更有针对性地调整配方了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181006,
					"content": "#嗯，肯定没问题的。真是多谢你们了，特别是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，真是了不起的小嵴锋龙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181007,
					"content": "呀呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181008,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，听别人夸{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，感觉比自己被夸更高兴呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181009,
					"content": "能和小嵴锋龙这样默契的两位也很了不起！我也得向你们学习才行呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181010,
						750181011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181010,
					"content": "真不愧是我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181012
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750181012,
					"content": "虽然想说有什么我能帮到你们或者为你们做的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181013,
					"content": "但还是祝你们健健康康，最好永远也不需要找我帮忙吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181014,
					"content": "啊，不过如果你们只是想来和我聊聊天，随时欢迎你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181015,
					"content": "好哦，也祝咕噜噜能早点恢复，至少别再不由分说就乱打人了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181016,
					"content": "这个嘛…就相信我吧，之后我也会想想办法的。伤养好了，说不定脾气自然也就变好了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "玛兹嘉"
				},
				{
					"id": 750181011,
					"content": "#哪里，还是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}更了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750181012
					]
				}
			]
		},
